=== log levels
import log
log.debug("hidden by default")
log.info("starting")
log.warn("careful", fields: ["user": "ann", "id": "7"])
log.error("failed")
--- stderr
INFO starting
WARN careful user=ann id=7
ERROR failed

=== set level
import log
log.set_level("debug")
log.debug("now visible")
log.set_level("error")
log.warn("hidden")
log.error("shown")
log.set_level("off")
log.error("hidden too")
--- stderr
DEBUG now visible
ERROR shown

=== keys and values with spaces are quoted
import log
log.info("msg", fields: ["path": "a b", "a=b": "", "q": "say \"hi\""])
--- stderr
INFO msg path="a b" "a=b"="" q="say \"hi\""

=== messages with control characters are quoted
import log
log.info("two\nlines", fields: ["x": "1"])
log.info("one line")
--- stderr
INFO "two\nlines" x=1
INFO one line
